Package: threshreg
Title: Threshold-Censored Negative Binomial Regression
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Adam", "Authur", , "aauthur@tamu.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Data is often subject to reporting rules that hide
    observations below a specified threshold. When this threshold is known,
    information about the unobserved observations can be incorporated rather than discarded. 
    This package fits negative binomial regression models that account for threshold censoring, with
    additional functionality for working with network data.
